      "description": "Windows PowerShell 5.1 writes to Microsoft-Windows-PowerShell/Operational and PowerShell 7 writes to PowerShellCore/Operational. With Script Block Logging enabled, PowerShell records the content of the script blocks it processes (event 4104). Module logging records pipeline execution for selected modules (event 4103).",
